Package: dstatree
Title: Tree-Aware Filtering of D-Statistic Tables
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Your", "Ruben Muller-Perol", email = "rubenmullerperol@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Filters tables of D-statistic (ABBA-BABA) results so that only
    trios consistent with a rooted species tree are kept. Adds p-values with
    multiple-testing correction, and reports significant signals involving
    sister species pairs or larger clades. Can be used through plain functions
    or through a single object that stores the tree and the table.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/RMP-deb/dstatree
BugReports: https://github.com/RMP-deb/dstatree/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: ape, methods, stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
